window.WILDS_UPDATES = {"discord":"https://discord.gg/rsdwwiki","updates":[{"title":"Our 1.0 Check-In Survey is now Live!","date":"1 October 2026","category":"","officialUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1374490/view/684140727200907793","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3AOur_1.0_Check-In_Survey_is_now_Live%21","summary":"Hello adventurers! While we're continuing our work on the updates for 1.0 and while the patch for 1.0.0.7 is being processed on platforms, we're back with our regularly scheduled Check-in Survey! The survey will be available until 7AM GMT on the 8th October 2026. As always, if you're encountering bugs, head to the Bug Reports in our Official Discord. Click here to complete the Survey!"},{"title":"Save Corruptions - An Update","date":"","category":"","officialUrl":"","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3ASave_Corruptions_-_An_Update","summary":"Hello Adventurers, Around a thousand of our players across Consoles and PC Game Pass during the launch window were affected by an issue where disconnecting the game, putting consoles in sleep mode or otherwise would lead to saves being rendered unreadable or inaccessible. The main culprit of this was editing your character’s appearance. We’ve since disabled this feature and rolled out a fix to pre"},{"title":"1.0.0.6 is now Live!","date":"29 September 2026","category":"Regular Update","officialUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1374490/view/684140095047993655","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3A1.0.0.6_is_now_Live%21","summary":"* Epic Games Store players are now back online and can enjoy Crossplay again! * Resolved an issue where users could quit the Edit Appearance menu before the Character Save had completed. ** This is a preventative measure - work towards currently affected \"corrupted\" saves is still ongoing. We'll share an update later today * Resolved an issue on PC where incorrect filenames would be accepted a Cha"},{"title":"The Wrath of the Dragon Event is live TOMORROW!","date":"18 September 2026","category":"Live-Stream/Broadcast","officialUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1374490/view/716790555855553156","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3AThe_Wrath_of_the_Dragon_Event_is_live_TOMORROW%21","summary":"zDizrdhPuEo RuneScape: Dragonwilds is celebrating its launch with our biggest ever Creator-driven event: Wrath of the Dragons! Tomorrow, on Saturday 19th September, at 9AM PDT/12PM EDT/5PM BST/6PM CET, 32 creators will step into Dragonwilds’ 1.0 release, and will be given just 6 hours to prepare a fresh character to beat the first Dragon in Dragonwilds - Velgar. Whether you first slayed a big gree"},{"title":"Our 1.0 Release is live!","date":"","category":"","officialUrl":"","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3AOur_1.0_Release_is_live%21","summary":"Today marks the start of our next journey. Thank you to the millions (yes, millions!) of you who joined us during Early Access. We're now live on PlayStation 5, Nintendo Switch 2, XBOX Series X | S and PC on Epic Games Store, Jagex Launcher and Steam. ==Our Early Access Journey== In April 2025 we launched into Early Access with the first Dragon General, Velgar, and the first two regions: Brynmoor"},{"title":"Dragonwilds' Price Isn't Changing","date":"","category":"","officialUrl":"","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3ADragonwilds%27_Price_Isn%27t_Changing","summary":"__NOTOC__\"We've been continually humbled by your support, and we've decided not to raise the price of RuneScape: Dragonwilds following our 1.0 release - it will stay at £24.99 or $29.99.\" Since we launched into Early Access, we've been extremely proud of the amazing work that has gone into RuneScape: Dragonwilds. So many of you have taken the plunge into Ashenfall, and with every update we are hum"},{"title":"Changing the Abyssal Whip","date":"","category":"","officialUrl":"","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3AChanging_the_Abyssal_Whip","summary":"__NOTOC__\"How hard could it be to make your own? ...It comes pre-segmented, pre-made from some of the hardiest organic material known to mortal-kind. Perhaps there is a way, a method, to turn this... thing into something that lives up to the legend.\" Since we launched RuneScape: Dragonwilds into Early Access, we've been home to an iconic weapon. A tool of death, with a huge legacy. From its introd"},{"title":"We're coming to Xbox Game Pass!","date":"","category":"","officialUrl":"","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3AWe%27re_coming_to_Xbox_Game_Pass%21","summary":"We're coming to Xbox Game Pass! Our incredible journey through Early Access is coming to an end, and the next chapter of our adventure begins with arriving on consoles, free for Xbox Game Pass holders! Launching worldwide on September 15th, the iconic RuneScape franchise arrives on consoles for the first time in 25 years! Not heard of us yet? Let us introduce ourselves… dwuZB-3FGyg RuneScape: Drag"},{"title":"Enter Our Launch Giveaway!","date":"","category":"","officialUrl":"","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3AEnter_Our_Launch_Giveaway%21","summary":"Enter Our Launch Giveaway! Hello adventurers! It's been a long time since we did a big giveaway to celebrate - and we have quite the thing to celebrate now! RuneScape: Dragonwilds is launching worldwide on consoles on September 15th. To celebrate the release, we're opening up a giveaway for you all! CLICK HERE TO JOIN THE GIVEAWAY! We're giving away FOUR prizes - a Nintendo Switch 2 console, a Pla"},{"title":"The 2026 Golden Gnome Finalists!","date":"","category":"","officialUrl":"","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3AThe_2026_Golden_Gnome_Finalists%21","summary":"__NOTOC__ We've collected your nominations, crunched the numbers, done our due diligence and now it's time to share the finalists for this year's most prestigious awards show in all of Gielinor! While the shortlists below represent the top winners, it must be said that we've been totally humbled by the volume of nominations, submissions and creativity we've seen highlighted and put on display. The"},{"title":"Our 0.12.1 Update Survey is now live!","date":"6 August 2026","category":"","officialUrl":"","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3AOur_0.12.1_Update_Survey_is_now_live%21","summary":"Got feedback on 0.12.1 and got 10 minutes spare? We want to hear from you! Our 0.12.1 survey is live now! We know not everybody will have detailed feedback to share or have experienced everything we ask about yet. Text boxes throughout the survey are optional, but we would love as much feedback as possible, so we appreciate you taking the time to give us more detail where you can.This survey will"},{"title":"0.12.1.4 is now live!","date":"","category":"","officialUrl":"","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3A0.12.1.4_is_now_live%21","summary":"0.12.1.4 is now live! Dedicated Servers will need to be restarted to sync updates. Here's what we're fixing in this hotfix. - Resolved an issue where subtitles for cinematics were not displaying correctly in Traditional Chinese. - Fixed an issue affecting invisible burn damage anywhere a Tok Xil has been. - Resolved an issue with Kebbit Burrows where users could only access them if they hadn't bee"},{"title":"0.12.1.3 is now live!","date":"31 July 2026","category":"Small Update/Patch Notes","officialUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1374490/view/698771718397757095","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3A0.12.1.3_is_now_live%21","summary":"Dedicated Servers will need to be restarted to sync updates. 0.12.1.3 - Bombastic-Aardvark is Live! Here's what we're resolving in this hotfix. * Resolved an issue where users would take excessive fall damage when jumping over any height when mounted. * Fixed an issue where users would be unable to respawn on agility courses, requiring a game restart."},{"title":"Kuldra's Saga - An Update From Mod Dutch","date":"31 July 2026","category":"News","officialUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1374490/view/698771718397757064","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3AKuldra%27s_Saga_-_An_Update_From_Mod_Dutch","summary":"It is I, Mod Dutch, come to you with a message about the future of Dragonwilds. I assure you, it is good news! ==Hello Adventurers!== It is I, Mod Dutch, come to you with a message about the future of Dragonwilds. Hold on, sheath that sword, ease your bowstring and pause casting that water spell, I assure you, it is good news! ==TL;DR: Our 1.0 release on September 15th is not the end of Dragonwild"},{"title":"0.12.1.2 is now live!","date":"31 July 2026","category":"Small Update/Patch Notes","officialUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1374490/view/698771718397757056","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3A0.12.1.2_is_now_live%21","summary":"Dedicated Servers will need to be restarted to sync updates. Here's what we're fixing in this hotfix. * Resolved an issue where users couldn't use Mounts after completing an Agility Course. * Fixed an issue with shadows not showing correctly on Grass at certain times of day/lighting conditions. * Fixed an issue where Traditional Chinese wasn't available as an in-game language option in the setting"},{"title":"0.12.1.1 is now live!","date":"30 July 2026","category":"Small Update/Patch Notes","officialUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1374490/view/698771718397756182","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3A0.12.1.1_is_now_live%21","summary":"Dedicated Servers will need to be restarted to sync updates. Here's what we're fixing in this hotfix. * Resolved an issue affecting the Great Body Robbery where players could soft-lock themselves out of dialogue. * Agility Completion Times now persist between sessions on both Dedicated Servers and Hosted Worlds. * Fixed an issue where TokTz Ket Xil shield vestige would not drop in some circumstanc"},{"title":"0.12.1 is now live!","date":"29 July 2026","category":"Regular Update","officialUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/1374490/view/698771718397755635","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3A0.12.1_is_now_live%21","summary":"Agility, Combat Tweaks, Bugfixes and our longest Secondary Quest to date! __NOTOC__ ==Agility== With the 0.12.1 release, we're delighted to be introducing a long-overdue addition to RuneScape: Dragonwilds - Agility! Our latest skill will allow you to build up your stamina and sculpt yourself into a speed machine. Across Ashenfall, you'll find SIX new stations with flags for you to interact with. T"},{"title":"Eye on Ashenfall - 0.12.1","date":"","category":"","officialUrl":"","wikiUrl":"https://dragonwilds.runescape.wiki/w/Update%3AEye_on_Ashenfall_-_0.12.1","summary":"Hello Adventurers! Dragonwilds' latest update before the Scorned Wilderness Raid arrives is coming to Steam Early Access soon! Let's get an early look at what it'll contain: == Agility == With the 0.12.1 release, we're delighted to be introducing a long-overdue addition to RuneScape: Dragonwilds - Agility! Our latest skill will allow you to build up your stamina and sculpt yourself into a speed ma"}]};
